  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening and Enhancing Network Development and Accountability of Civil Society Organizations(CS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is contributing to the civil society development program of the joint office (over years 2009-2012). This project tries to address the organization and networking of civil societies at regional level (between CSOs/CBOs/NGOs and relevant government sectors) and have a smooth, appreciative and constructive way of dialogue with the government institutions, empower member organizations and enhance their participation in the socio-economic development of the region. Due to the intervention through this project, the following are expected to be achieved: 
&#x2022;	Accountability and transparency to citizens enhanced;
&#x2022;	CSOs/CBOs  involvement in development policy dialogue in place
&#x2022;	Interest of diversified CSOs/CBOs effectively coordinated by 
&#x2022;	Effective CSOs/CBOs networks coordinate diversified interests of member organizations
These achievements are going to be obtained through:
&#x2022;	Design strong information network intra and inter ACSOT members; 
&#x2022;	Ensure accountability and transparent system to members;
&#x2022;	Ensure standard and uniform working environment among member organizations;
&#x2022;	Maintain periodic monitoring and mentoring  program to control and track the execution of activities and provision of technical support to members respectively; 
&#x2022;	Disseminate relevant and updated information to members regularly;</narrative>
  </description>
